<title>ZAMBIA: Zambia's M3 money supply up 34 pct yr/yr in May.</title>
<headline>Zambia's M3 money supply up 34 pct yr/yr in May.</headline>
<dateline>LUSAKA 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zambia's year-on-year broadly defined M3 money supply rose by 34 percent in April, the central bank said.</p>
<p>			    May 1997	  Apr 1997	  May 1996</p>
<p>M3 (Zk' million)	659,156.8	 618,311.2	 492,211.4</p>
<p>-- Lusaka newsroom + 260-1-222689</p>
</text>
